ate><author>小Lin说</author></item><item><title>伊朗战争，和全球能源格局</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116281172825239&amp;amp;cid=undefined&amp;amp;bvid=BV1QGXABxEbq" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/1a926746ec7bdb789b54670ced7603949c6ec75d.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;伊朗战争开打后，原油价格从65美元一度暴涨到超过110美元。 咱们今天，就来聊聊这次战争，然后再更深入一点，顺便来看看后俄乌战争时期，全球整体是一个什么能源格局。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1QGXABxEbq</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1QGXABxEbq</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Mar 2026 03:30:00 GMT</pubDate><author>小Lin说</author></item><item><title>做自媒体6年了，我想说…</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116224818156717&amp;amp;cid=undefined&amp;amp;bvid=BV1ZDwHzyEFm" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/9b34823c6e768773387e56f562ca188d22e19329.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;今天咱不聊商业不了经济，咱们来联络联络感情～ 向小Lin"奶茶店"的股东们，汇报一下，这一年来我有什么感悟和想法，也回答一些大家感兴趣的话题～</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1ZDwHzyEFm</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1ZDwHzyEFm</guid><pubDate>Sat, 14 Mar 2026 03:30:00 GMT</pubDate><author>小Lin说</author></item><item><title>消失的折痕，究竟经历了什么？</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116204987489672&amp;amp;cid=undefined&amp;amp;bvid=BV19PcXzWEuc" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/a6646235ae12ce09b1d52117f2fd7f073d342a63.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV19PcXzWEuc</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV19PcXzWEuc</guid><pubDate>Wed, 11 Mar 2026 08:00:00 GMT</pubDate><author>小Lin说</author></item><item><title>黄金白银大崩盘，谁是幕后推手？</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116113987867112&amp;amp;cid=undefined&amp;amp;bvid=BV1MxfcBhEdo" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/dcd6773c90f3c53e306d345dcf2df7e5fb2c3eb8.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;2026年1月份，简直是贵金属有史以来最疯狂的一个月了。 先是持续攀升大涨68%，涨到了超过120美元，紧接着2天跌回解放前； 黄金一个月涨了将近30%，突破了$5500，之后也是暴跌。 咱来拆解一下这个贵金属市场的巨震，到底是咋回事儿~</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1MxfcBhEdo</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1MxfcBhEdo</guid><pubDate>Mon, 23 Feb 2026 09:30:00 GMT</pubDate><author>小Lin说</author></item><item><title>坐拥金山，却变成人间炼狱，委内瑞拉到底经历了什么?</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=115993493903196&amp;amp;cid=undefined&amp;amp;bvid=BV1xN6xBjEqy" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/08c074b76588847b83759f39fd6aa587af0d9b3c.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;委内瑞拉，作为全球石油储量最高的国家，却在不到十年的时间里，GDP下降了 80%。 据联合国的估算，2024年有82%的人生活在贫困线以下，它十多年陷在恶性通胀的火炉中，钱都要论斤称。 咱们一起来看看，它是怎么把一手好牌，打成这样的?</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1xN6xBjEqy</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1xN6xBjEqy</guid><pubDate>Sun, 01 Feb 2026 09:30:00 GMT</pubDate><author>小Lin说</author></item><item><title>【年度总结】一口气了解过去一年的全球经济｜关税战新格局</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=115785037059324&amp;amp;cid=undefined&amp;amp;bvid=BV111BeBPEaD" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/eb1ec2865dc70633540ae791ad0dcbf1b0a5cb4d.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;2025年，这么多杂乱的头条新闻，到底拼凑出怎么样新的贸易格局？ 美国、中国内部经济面临怎么样的困境？ 经济动荡怎么催生了德国、日本的政治动荡？ 谁，又是全球经济的最强发动机？</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV111BeBPEaD</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV111BeBPEaD</guid><pubDate>Mon, 29 Dec 2025 03:00:00 GMT</pubDate><author>小Lin说</author></item><item><title>"十五五" 规划里，藏了什么重点？</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=115783090839511&amp;amp;cid=undefined&amp;amp;bvid=BV1tnBZBBEmG" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/2fbde44530f871aa5e6563bb6d5aa7ab340ec571.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1tnBZBBEmG</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1tnBZBBEmG</guid><pubDate>Fri, 26 Dec 2025 09:30:00 GMT</pubDate><author>小Lin说</author></item><item><title>同一款药价格差3倍，中国药价体系背后有何玄机？</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=115740292225855&amp;amp;cid=undefined&amp;amp;bvid=BV18KqpBMEiw" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/8bb45d2a0941100a2ba299115dcc8ff5bb647ea1.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV18KqpBMEiw</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV18KqpBMEiw</guid><pubDate>Thu, 18 Dec 2025 11:55:19 GMT</pubDate><author>小Lin说</author></item><item><title>日本财团，背后有什么玄机？</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=115722105658349&amp;amp;cid=undefined&amp;amp;bvid=BV1ppmCBVEww" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/5463615b51447f77cbefa9ce4c33c5b7927cbea5.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;财团，在日本经济的地位非常重要。 最大的三家财团：三菱、三井、住友，占据了日本国内约60%的销售额。 今天，我们挖一挖这些财团，看看这张隐秘的网络到底是怎么运作的。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1ppmCBVEww</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1ppmCBVEww</guid><pubDate>Mon, 15 Dec 2025 09:30:00 GMT</pubDate><author>小Lin说</author></item><item><title>一口气了解赌球</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=115699859070921&amp;amp;cid=undefined&amp;amp;bvid=BV1NQmTBmEj5" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/2a72489ea5a24e6897096642f4f84cd70e65f4ea.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;其实我们今天要聊的，确切来说，是体育博彩。 这里包括线上、线下，包括赌球、赌马，包括赌场、博彩平台，也包括体育彩票。 咱们今天就来一口气聊聊，这个游走在法律边缘的产业 - 体育博彩。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1NQmTBmEj5</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1NQmTBmEj5</guid><pubDate>Thu, 11 Dec 2025 10:00:00 GMT</pubDate><author>小Lin说</author></item><item><title>GDP是会骗人的 | 一口气了解GDP</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=115547555502685&amp;amp;cid=undefined&amp;amp;bvid=BV1EjCgBeEn5" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/856f17b0c01d3b40b393bc2d030e52ea56e9e9c2.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;GDP可以说是衡量各国经济最最最最常用的指标了，你以为它就是个数，不会骗人，结果却有这么多版本～ 这背后的门道可不简单。咱们今天就来聊聊这个你最熟悉，但又最会骗人的指标 - GDP。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1EjCgBeEn5</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1EjCgBeEn5</guid><pubDate>Fri, 14 Nov 2025 10:26:27 GMT</pubDate><author>小Lin说</author></item><item><title>那些被制裁最最严重的国家，都怎么样了?</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=115433218774842&amp;amp;cid=undefined&amp;amp;bvid=BV1qVsRzbEQ2" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/7202452a9b86ca1b00c431ca60a1d4f67cb14244.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;我们今天会通过五个最有特点、最有影响力、大家都耳熟能详的国家制裁，来深入探究一下，制裁的底层逻辑。它有哪些手段？被制裁的国家能够如何反制？ 还有最关键的，制裁到底管不管用？</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1qVsRzbEQ2</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1qVsRzbEQ2</guid><pubDate>Sat, 25 Oct 2025 09:30:00 GMT</pubDate><author>小Lin说</author></item><item><title>全球乱跑的"最贵"视频，看我发现了什么…？</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=115376411186962&amp;amp;cid=undefined&amp;amp;bvid=BV1wK4vznEW3" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/aa304f05f99987dc570f2f1aceb15393b1880230.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1wK4vznEW3</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1wK4vznEW3</guid><pubDate>Wed, 15 Oct 2025 09:36:30 GMT</pubDate><author>小Lin说</author></item><item><title>美元暴跌的背后...</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=115360070114032&amp;amp;cid=undefined&amp;amp;bvid=BV14U4uzRE1X" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/3230af70dd3d8e61de0e29b4f23393260c0c1c68.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;朋友们，不知道你们有没有意识到，美元今年跌惨了，上半年是近半个世纪表现最差的一年。 下半年到现在也持续疲软，从年初到现在美元指数已经下跌了超过10%。 而与此同时，全球的资产价格都出现了久违的爆发。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV14U4uzRE1X</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV14U4uzRE1X</guid><pubDate>Sun, 12 Oct 2025 09:40:08 GMT</pubDate><author>小Lin说</author></item><item><title>一口气了解伊朗经济</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=115212749381492&amp;amp;cid=undefined&amp;amp;bvid=BV1MEp1z7EAx" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/2e8431bf43f9a2de584fdc7681540a265a6d1bd7.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;今天我们就继续国家经济系列： 看看伊朗是怎么一步一步走到今天?演变出了一套什么样复杂的政治结构?长出两只什么样的奇怪的手? 一起走进这个夹缝中生存的国家 - 伊朗。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1MEp1z7EAx</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1MEp1z7EAx</guid><pubDate>Tue, 16 Sep 2025 09:30:00 GMT</pubDate><author>小Lin说</author></item><item><title>中国经济2025 (小结, 简单聊聊)</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=115110676797601&amp;amp;cid=undefined&amp;amp;bvid=BV1A3hRzpEY5" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/9f10d2cf63b6e6b6f0e057365735ff84da12cc70.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;中国2025年上半年的GDP增速达到了5.3%，数字非常ok，但大家的体感似乎并不太ok，为什么会有这样的反差呢？ 咱们今天就来梳理一下：今年的中国经济，有什么重点方向、有什么问题、又准备怎么应对？</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1A3hRzpEY5</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1A3hRzpEY5</guid><pubDate>Fri, 29 Aug 2025 09:30:00 GMT</pubDate><author>小Lin说</author></item><item><title>期货，为什么总是拉爆债市、股市、油价？ 资本世界的多空大战有多凶残...</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=115053651040552&amp;amp;cid=undefined&amp;amp;bvid=BV12YeczEE6x" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/fa12f5c0c3961a4ccf2f7200c1a717320eb6b7d6.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;朋友们，今天咱们来用一系列非常精彩而又经典的例子，来聊聊资本围绕期货的明争暗斗。 一个这么正常的金融衍生品，为什么就能拉爆债市、拉爆股市、拉爆油价？ 这背后是什么逻辑？</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV12YeczEE6x</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV12YeczEE6x</guid><pubDate>Tue, 19 Aug 2025 09:30:00 GMT</pubDate><author>小Lin说</author></item><item><title>机器人，真的要来了么...？</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=115008839162586&amp;amp;cid=undefined&amp;amp;bvid=BV1AcbVzwEEc" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/f60dfc0e4779dcea4b88dc61a7f6bc073e928507.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1AcbVzwEEc</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1AcbVzwEEc</guid><pubDate>Mon, 11 Aug 2025 09:30:00 GMT</pubDate><author>小Lin说</author></item><item><title>什么是"金融赌场"，它背后有什么秘密？</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=114946092307834&amp;amp;cid=undefined&amp;amp;bvid=BV1ZG8kzuEnD" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/c929917ce8d1541b51398e1e539dcb7bfedd1356.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;期货市场，从成交面值来看，总成交量甚至超过了外汇市场，是全球最大的交易市场，堪称金融产品之王。 今天我们就来聊一聊，期货表面上是什么，本质上又是什么，有什么特点，又是如何被资本市场玩出花的？</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1ZG8kzuEnD</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1ZG8kzuEnD</guid><pubDate>Thu, 31 Jul 2025 09:30:00 GMT</